Package: damSleep
Type: Package
Title: Sleep and Locomotor Activity from Drosophila Activity Monitor (DAM) Recordings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Khushi", "Singh", email = "khushisi175@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A configurable pipeline for sleep and activity experiments recorded
    with Drosophila Activity Monitors (TriKinetics DAM2). Builds on the
    Rethomics packages (behavr, damr, sleepr, ggetho): reads and cleans the
    metadata, loads the monitor files with sleep annotation (immobility of at
    least 5 min), removes dead animals while keeping flies that are only asleep
    at the end of the recording, and summarises each fly (total, day and night
    sleep, bout number and length, sleep latency after lights-off, activity per
    day and per waking minute). Each test genotype is compared with every
    control by Wilcoxon rank-sum tests with Holm correction, separately by sex.
    Quality-control tiles, population sleep and activity profiles, actograms,
    profiles of each mutant against the controls and annotated summary plots
    are written together with the tables.
